---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Signup from '../components/Signup.astro';
import ExecCTA from '../components/ExecCTA.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../config';
---
<Base
  title="Join"
  description="Two fellowships, an executive group, and a mailing list. Open to every discipline, no prerequisites."
>
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Join</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Four ways in, from an email address to running part of the group. None of them needs a
        technical background or any prior knowledge of AI safety.
      </p>

      <div class="row">
        <h2>Fellowships</h2>
        <div>
        <div class="grid grid--2">
          <div class="block">
            <h3>Technical Fellowship</h3>
            <span class="meta">January 2027 · Weekly, about 90 minutes</span>
            <p>
              An introduction to the technical side of AI safety: how modern AI systems are
              trained, why aligning them is difficult, and current research in areas such as
              mechanistic interpretability.
            </p>
            <p>
              No prerequisites, and no assumption you have done machine learning before.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="block">
            <h3>Policy Fellowship</h3>
            <span class="meta">January 2027 · Weekly, about 90 minutes</span>
            <p>
              An introduction to AI governance: the risks posed by advanced AI, how governments
              and companies are responding, and what effective policy could look like. No
              technical background required.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--wash">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <div class="row">
        <h2>Other ways in</h2>
        <div>
        <div class="grid grid--2">
          <div class="block">
            <h3>Executive membership</h3>
            <span class="meta">Recruiting now · A few hours a week</span>
            <p class="block__lead">
              We are selecting on reliability, not credentials. A group fails when its core does
              not show up, not when it lacks a star.
            </p>
            <p>
              We are recruiting a small executive core for this year: booking rooms, running
              sessions, reaching out to speakers, building the curriculum. A few hours a week,
              one planning meeting, and one area owned through the year. Co-op semesters are
              expected and we will work around them.
            </p>
            <div class="actions">
              <ExecCTA />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="block">
            <h3>Mailing list</h3>
            <span class="meta">Open now · An email address</span>
            <p class="block__lead">
              Anyone at Northeastern. Undergraduate, master’s, PhD, any program, and no
              commitment beyond an email address.
            </p>
            <p>
              We particularly want people from policy, law, security, biology, psychology, design
              and business. AI safety is not only a machine learning problem, and a room that is
              only engineers will miss things.
            </p>
            <div class="actions">
              <Signup />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <div class="row">
        <h2>How to join</h2>
        <div>
        <p>
          The fellowships start in January 2027. Sign up for the mailing list and we will email
          you before they begin, with a time, a place, and what to read. No application, no
          interview. The executive group has its own short form.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you are technical and already know this field, there is a version of this group that
          is about producing research rather than reading it, and we want you for that.
          <a class="arrow" href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}><span>Email us directly</span></a> instead of
          only joining the list, and we will talk about what you want to work on.
        </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
